# SubSense frontend build configuration. Copy to frontend/.env.local for local overrides.
#
# Every VITE_ variable is compiled into the public JavaScript bundle and visible to anyone.
# NEVER put secrets, API keys or database connection strings (e.g. an Atlas URI) here.
#
# Base URL of the SubSense API.
#   Development default (unset): http://localhost:5000/api
#   Production default (unset):  /api  — same-origin path, proxied by the host to the API
#                                (recommended: keeps the session cookie first-party; see
#                                backend/docs/PHASE_5_1_PRODUCTION_READINESS.md)
# Only set it to call an API on another origin directly (that API must list this site in
# CLIENT_ORIGIN, and cross-site cookies may be blocked by the browser).
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
